<p>Hype Cycle for AI 2025 (Gartner) Sumber: https://www.gartner.com/en/newsroom/press-releases/2025-08-05-gartner-hype-cycle-identifies- top-ai-innovations-in-2025 Inteligensi Buatan 2026 10</p>
